[
  {
    "id": "3461b8b9-b4df-50ca-8017-c5e502518e5e",
    "pack": "character-guide",
    "kind": "heritage",
    "slug": "heritage:anvil-dwarf",
    "name": "Anvil Dwarf",
    "rarity": "common",
    "traits": [],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "character-guide",
        "aon": "https://2e.aonprd.com/Heritages.aspx?ID=31",
        "page": 19
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You are a descendant of a famed crafter and have your own amazing talent. Other dwarves might consider this a blessing from your ancestors or from the Forgefather himself, depending on where you grew up. You become trained in Crafting (or another skill if you were already trained in Crafting) and gain the "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "cf2fb4e9-9adb-5092-9f78-5dd9b3192301"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " skill feat, but you can pick two different specialties instead of one."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "key": "Proficiency",
        "selector": "skill:crafting",
        "rank": "trained"
      },
      {
        "key": "GrantItem",
        "item": "cf2fb4e9-9adb-5092-9f78-5dd9b3192301"
      },
      {
        "key": "GrantItem",
        "item": "cf2fb4e9-9adb-5092-9f78-5dd9b3192301"
      }
    ],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.heritages.Item.kRDsVbhdBVeSlpBa"
    },
    "data": {
      "ancestry": "e6d808d9-95b9-5477-8322-791194226314"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "ed60c1b9-ae43-5e28-9bfd-ffe82383320d",
    "pack": "character-guide",
    "kind": "heritage",
    "slug": "heritage:desert-elf",
    "name": "Desert Elf",
    "rarity": "common",
    "traits": [],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "character-guide",
        "aon": "https://2e.aonprd.com/Heritages.aspx?ID=35",
        "page": 25
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You live under the desert's blazing heat, gaining incredible resilience to warm environments. You gain fire resistance equal to half your level (minimum 1), and environmental heat effects are one step less extreme for you (incredible heat becomes extreme, extreme heat becomes severe, and so on)."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "key": "Resistance",
        "type": ["fire"],
        "value": "max(1, floor(@level / 2))"
      }
    ],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.heritages.Item.kiKxnKd7Dfegk9dM"
    },
    "data": {
      "ancestry": "85929532-15d1-52c2-8500-d3b27f174266"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "0548e8de-6525-505b-b58e-74aa54ce0fa4",
    "pack": "character-guide",
    "kind": "heritage",
    "slug": "heritage:elemental-heart-dwarf",
    "name": "Elemental Heart Dwarf",
    "rarity": "common",
    "traits": [],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "character-guide",
        "aon": "https://2e.aonprd.com/Heritages.aspx?ID=32",
        "page": 19
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Whether through a connection to "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "353363db-a5c9-5093-a83d-5091fea2308d",
            "label": "Torag's"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " forge, the azers of the Plane of Fire, or another source, you can exude a burst of energy. Mbe'ke and Taralu dwarves of the Mwangi Expanse believe this heritage is a gift from dragons or elemental spirits. Choose one of the following damage types: acid, cold, electricity, or fire. Once chosen, this can't be changed. You gain the "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "61ecd9da-430c-53b8-8218-53ff9a360bb4"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " activity."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "key": "GrantItem",
        "item": "61ecd9da-430c-53b8-8218-53ff9a360bb4"
      }
    ],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.heritages.Item.MeMAAtUlZmFgKSMF"
    },
    "data": {
      "ancestry": "e6d808d9-95b9-5477-8322-791194226314"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "311169db-49ef-5a2d-b2a1-a880c4f5a990",
    "pack": "character-guide",
    "kind": "heritage",
    "slug": "heritage:oathkeeper-dwarf",
    "name": "Oathkeeper Dwarf",
    "rarity": "common",
    "traits": [],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "character-guide",
        "aon": "https://2e.aonprd.com/Heritages.aspx?ID=33",
        "page": 19
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Growing up, you never tried to lie to get what you wanted, and even when necessary, lying makes you uncomfortable. The especially faithful might even have thought that you were blessed by the dwarven god of duty, "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "628bbb26-f97c-5b71-8d94-5248c0e5016f"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You gain a +1 circumstance bonus to Perception checks to "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "775b68f2-1542-5f47-bc0d-87d5884d7baa"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " and to Perception DCs against attempts to "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "1ee7b671-dd18-5950-a4db-fbd4f8dae832"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " to you."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Furthermore, you gain a +2 circumstance bonus to Diplomacy checks to convince others you speak the truth when you are telling the truth, and you take a -4 circumstance penalty to lie and to your Deception DC against "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "775b68f2-1542-5f47-bc0d-87d5884d7baa"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "key": "FlatModifier",
        "selectors": ["perception"],
        "type": "circumstance",
        "value": 1,
        "slug": "oathkeeper-dwarf-to-sense-motive",
        "predicate": ["action:sense-motive"],
        "display": {
          "label": "to Sense Motive"
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "FlatModifier",
        "selectors": ["skill:diplomacy"],
        "type": "circumstance",
        "value": 2,
        "slug": "oathkeeper-dwarf-tell-the-truth",
        "predicate": ["option:tell-truth"],
        "display": {
          "label": "To Tell the Truth"
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "FlatModifier",
        "selectors": ["skill:deception"],
        "type": "circumstance",
        "value": -4,
        "slug": "oathkeeper-dwarf-lie",
        "predicate": ["action:lie"],
        "display": {
          "label": "To Lie"
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "FlatModifier",
        "selectors": ["perception"],
        "type": "circumstance",
        "value": 1,
        "predicate": ["action:lie"]
      },
      {
        "key": "FlatModifier",
        "selectors": ["skill:deception"],
        "type": "circumstance",
        "value": -4,
        "predicate": ["action:sense-motive"]
      }
    ],
